Cho copy file log .BIN cua SITL ve xem (Phase 03, viec 03.5).

Chi thu muc nay duoc giu trong git. Ban than file .BIN bi .gitignore chan
(luat *.BIN va *.bin toan repo) — do la CO Y: log bay nang va khong phai ma
nguon. DUNG dung `git add -f` de ep no vao.

Lay log tu WSL:
    ls -lt ~/ardupilot/ArduCopter/logs/ | head
    cp ~/ardupilot/ArduCopter/logs/<ten>.BIN /mnt/d/Coding/IOT-CV/logs/sitl/

Mo log: https://plotbeta.ardupilot.org/ (keo tha file vao trang, khong can cai gi)
